      "recap_tekst": "Argentina beat England 2-1.\nGoals: England — Gordon (55); Argentina — Fernandez (85) and Martinez (90+2).\n\nHolders Argentina fought back from the brink to beat England and advance to Sunday's FIFA World Cup 2026™ final against Spain.\nEnzo Fernandez and Lisandro Martinez struck the late goals in a dramatic turnaround in Atlanta just when England were closing in on their first final in 60 years, following Anthony Gordon's goal early in the second half.\nHolders Argentina staged a late fightback to defeat England 2-1 and advance to Sunday's final against Spain in New York New Jersey.\nInstead Lionel Scaloni's men can now look forward to their seventh World Cup final, and stand a step away from retaining their world crown.",
